      <item row="6" column="1">
       <widget class="QCheckBox" name="checkBox_autozero">
        <property name="toolTip">
         <string>PWM/DIR mode only. At startup, starting at the zero torque duty: if the wheel turns, ramps up fast until it stops.
Then slowly finds the duty where it starts turning forward and where it starts turning backwards, and uses the middle as zero torque point.
The wheel must be free and may turn up to 3 turns. Falls back to the zero torque duty above if it fails.</string>
        </property>
        <property name="text">
